<title>CHINA: Trading in China Travel shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in China Travel shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of China Travel International Investment Ltd was suspended on Wednesday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
<p>The company's shares ended unchanged at HK$4.60 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>China Travel, a unit of mainland tourism conglomerate China Travel Service, has made a general offer for shares of Sun Fook Kong Holdings Ltd after it bought 51.66 percent of the construction concern.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
